From 39b88bd50b59e47e2a612f9b6128916b12448705 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: unixyo <247697626+unixyo@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 27 Nov 2026 19:25:24 +0900
Subject: [PATCH] perf: add opt-in gfx1030 and Zen4 exact kernel optimizations

Add exact GDN DPP staging, QSA query LDS permutation, scoped Q6_K row dispatch, guarded singleton EXP10, Zen4 exact Down, and OWN-I8 single buffering. Preserve default dispatch, hybrid fail-closed behavior, and backend stubs.

Record accepted and rejected synthetic experiments, bounded model metadata, reproducible safety harnesses, settings, and V3 reports. Focused CTest 28/28, settings 8/8, watchdog 7/7, harness 17/17, and required Metal syntax pass. RAM-warm model ABBA/PPL/quality remain blocked by 42.530 GiB MemAvailable below the 45 GiB safety floor.
